{
  "description": "Player-controlled 6x6 turn-based grid-tactics skirmish: thin organism composing the std-tactics-board-2d frame + std-score — a two-marine fireteam vs two raiders. std-grid-tactics (inside the frame) is the SOLE units writer; the frame's PlayerIntent emits MOVE/ATTACK/AI_TURN intents only (never mutates units); fx-particles + round-flow + score listen. Select, move once, strike once, end turn; the enemy AI marches diagonally and mauls adjacents. Win by killing both raiders; lose when both marines fall.",
